  "job_A5_20251003_114226": {
    "chunk_text": "eard ealra \u00f0eoda. Hwylc is \u00fee gelic, ece drihten? Ne swiga \u00f0u, ne \u00fee sylfne bewere. For\u00feon \u00feine feond f\u00e6cne forwurdan, \u00fea \u00f0e f\u00e6ste \u00e6r feodan, drihten, and heora heafod wi\u00f0 \u00fee hofan Hi on \u00f0inum folce him facengeswipere syredan and feredan, and to swice hogedon, and ehtunga ealle Cw\u00e6dan cu\u00f0lice: Wutun cuman ealle and hi towyrpan geond wer\u00feeoda, \u00fe\u00e6t ne sy gemyndig manna For\u00feon hi an ge\u00feeaht ealle ymbs\u00e6tan, and gewitnesse wi\u00f0 \u00fee wise gesettan. Selegesceotu synd ons\u00e6gd in Idumea and Ism\u00e6helita, eac synt Moabes, Ammon and Ammalech, Cwom samod mid \u00f0am swylce Assur; ealle on wegum \u00e6ghw\u00e6r syndon on leodstefnum Lo\u00f0es Do him nu swa \u00f0u dydest dagum Madiane and Sisare, swylce Iabin; ealle \u00fea namon \u00c6ndor wylle and Sete heora ealdormenn swa \u00f0u Oreb dydest, Zeb and Zebee and Salmanaa, and heora ealdrum eallum Sete hi nu, min god, samod anlice swa se w\u00e6gnes hweol o\u00fe\u00fee windes healm, and swa f\u00e6rincga fyr Swa \u00feu hi on yrre ehtest and drefest, \u00fe\u00e6t hi on hrernesse hra\u00fee forweor\u00f0a\u00f0. Gedo \u00fe\u00e6t hiora ansyn awa sceamige, \u00feonne hi naman \u00feinne neode secea\u00f0. Ealle beo\u00f0 georette, eac gescende, and on weoruldlife weor\u00fea\u00f0 gedrefde, \u00feonne hi naman \u00feinne \u00deu ana eart",
